@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-29 - Upload Product Images

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Products UI" as FE
control "ShoesController" as API
control "ShoesService" as Service
database "MongoDB: shoes, shoesDetail, counters" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-29
FE -> API: R2 media workflow; upload endpoint recommended
API -> Service: Execute Upload Product Images
Service -> DB: Read/write shoes, shoesDetail, counters
DB --> Service: Domain data
participant "Cloudflare R2" as R2
Service -> R2: List or store media objects
R2 --> Service: Public media URLs
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Ảnh được upload lên R2

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: File không hợp lệ -> validation error
  note over FE,Service: R2 lỗi -> retry hoặc thông báo lỗi
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đang tạo/sửa sản phẩm
Post: Ảnh được upload lên R2
Main flow:
1. Admin chọn ảnh từ máy tính
2. System validate: type (jpeg/png/webp), size (max 5MB)
3. System gọi API R2 admin media pipeline; upload endpoint recommended
4. System upload ảnh lên Cloudflare R2
5. System trả về public URL
6. System cập nhật shoesDetail với URLs mới
end note
@enduml
